OL,3,GNEWSATop GCSE results in Wales see
OL,4,Aslight increase after major changes to
OL,5,Aqualifications
OL,6,
OL,7,FExam bosses said before the results
OL,8,Fwere announced that they were likely to
OL,9,Fshow "stability" as the new
OL,10,Fqualifications were phased in.
